  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support Minority Rights Group Europe for Civic Solidarity Platform 2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d Minority Rights Group Europe f&#xf6;r Civic Solidarity Platform f&#xf6;r 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to the Minority Rights Group Europe for the Civic Solidarity Platform network for the budget year 2023 to support i.a. human rights defender. The support contributes to promoting human rights and democracy and the principles of the rule of law.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Minority Rights Group Europe f&#xf6;r n&#xe4;tverket Civic Solidarity Platform f&#xf6;r budget&#xe5;ret 2023 f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja bl.a. m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare. St&#xf6;det bidrar till att fr&#xe4;mja m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och demokrati och r&#xe4;ttsstatens principer.</narrative>
  </description>
